                                                "sense_id": "783f4c76-7b9f-31ec-bf9f-94842ee70e3c",
                                                "text": "As a couple of soldiers sing a dirty song, he loses sight of the edge of the stage and falls off in the middle of his dance like a seasoned slapstick artist, his white legs in the air and his filthy underwear visible to all."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
